  "determination": true,
  "rationale": "`assets/skills/habeas/SKILL.md` is a bundled skill with front matter, so it is a site. After the `# Habeas` title and a short introductory paragraph, its first section is `## Workflow`. That section is an ordered, numbered checklist: step 1 picks the skill from a table, and step 2 says to follow that skill. The later sections (Testing and coverage artifacts, Inspecting, Requirements, References, Gotchas) all come after the workflow. The introductory paragraph sits under the title and is not a separate section, so the skill opens with its workflow before any other section. The requirement states no further obligations for its sites. The site's violation queries produced no matches to judge.",
